          "filename": "Six Bells Colliery, Abertillery. - geograph.org.uk - 718723.jpg",
          "caption": "Six Bells Colliery, Abertillery. This colliery dated from 1891 and was moribund in 1989. It has since been swept clear. We were here to see a small steam engine driven ventilating fan - a unique survivor (that didn't for much longer).",
